xt":"Yes, let's go!"},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"Yes, let's go!\". Cũng đúng: \"Yes, sure.\", \"Yes, let us go!\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["Yes, let's go!","Yes, sure.","Yes, let us go!"],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Có, đi thôi!\"","id":"u13n7l1-e08","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"I am from Vietnam."},{"id":"c2","text":"Yes, let's go!"},{"id":"c3","text":"I finish at six."}]},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"Yes, let's go!\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Có, đi thôi!\"","id":"u13n7l1-e08a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"Do you want to watch a movie together?\" — chọn câu trả lời phù hợp"},"skillIds":["speaking","u13.dialogue"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u3.want","u5.go","u13.movie","u13.watch","u13.together"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u13.d5.n","locale":"en-US","text":"Do you want to watch a movie together?"},"skillIds":["speaking","u13.dialogue"],"type":"dialogueTurn","vocabularyIds":["u1.yes","u3.want","u5.go","u13.movie","u13.watch","u13.together"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"Drawing"},{"id":"c2","text":"Swimming"},{"id":"c3","text":"Eating"}],"passage":"Every Saturday, Mai's school has clubs. Nam plays football. He is very good. Anna plays the piano and Tom plays the guitar. Together they make music. Mai cannot sing well, but she loves to dance. Huy likes to draw. Last Saturday, Linh came with her new camera and took many photos of everyone. Then Mai's father cooked chicken for them. \"What is your favorite hobby?\" Linh asked. \"Eating!\" Nam said.","question":"What is Nam's favorite hobby?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Eating\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Câu lạc bộ thứ Bảy\".","id":"u13n7l1-e09","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"What is Nam's favorite hobby?"},"skillIds":["reading","u13.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","imageAssetId":"i.u6.bathroom","text":"bathroom"},{"id":"c2","imageAssetId":"i.u9.dress","text":"dress"},{"id":"c3","imageAssetId":"i.u5.night","text":"night"},{"id":"c4","imageAssetId":"i.u13.game","text":"game"}]},"explanation":"\"game\" = \"trò chơi\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c4","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"trò chơi\" là \"game\".","id":"u13n7l1-e10","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Hình nào là \"trò chơi\"?"},"skillIds":["u13.vocab"],"type":"imageChoice","vocabularyIds":["u13.game"]},{"content":{"pairs":[{"id":"p1","left":{"id":"p1l","text":"guitar"},"right":{"id":"p1r","text":"đàn ghi-ta"}},{"id":"p2","left":{"id":"p2l","text":"swim"},"right":{"id":"p2r","text":"bơi"}},{"id":"p3","left":{"id":"p3l","text":"draw"},"right":{"id":"p3r","text":"vẽ"}},{"id":"p4","left":{"id":"p4l","text":"movie"},"right":{"id":"p4r","text":"bộ phim"}},{"id":"p5","left":{"id":"p5l","text":"photo"},"right":{"id":"p5r","text":"bức ảnh"}}]},"explanation":"guitar = đàn ghi-ta; swim = bơi; draw = vẽ; movie = bộ phim; photo = bức ảnh","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctPairIds":["p1","p2","p3","p4","p5"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Ví dụ: \"guitar\" = \"đàn ghi-ta\".","id":"u13n7l1-e11","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Nối các cặp từ tương ứng"},"skillIds":["u13.vocab"],"type":"matchPairs","vocabularyIds":["u13.guitar","u13.swim","u13.draw","u13.movie","u13.photo"]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"watch"},{"id":"c2","text":"open"},{"id":"c3","text":"meeting"},{"id":"c4","text":"park"}]},"explanation":"\"watch\" = \"xem\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c1","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"watch\" nghĩa là \"xem\".","id":"u13n7l1-e12","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"\"xem\" trong tiếng Anh là gì?"},"skillIds":["u13.vocab"],"type":"choice","vocabularyIds":["u13.watch"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":7,"referenceText":"My favorite sport is football."},"explanation":"Câu mẫu: \"My favorite sport is football.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["My favorite sport is football."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Nghĩa: \"Môn thể thao yêu thích của tôi là bóng đá.\"","id":"u13n7l1-e13","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"favorite"},{"id":"t2","text":"is"},{"id":"t3","text":"football"},{"id":"t4","text":"My"},{"id":"t5","text":"sport"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"My favorite sport is football.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t4","t1","t5","t2","t3"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Câu bắt đầu bằng \"My\".","id":"u13n7l1-e13a","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Sắp xếp thành câu đúng: \"Môn thể thao yêu thích của tôi là bóng đá.\""},"skillIds":["speaking","u13.grammar"],"type":"sentenceOrder","vocabularyIds":["u13.sport","u13.football","u13.favorite"]},"prompt":{"audioAssetId":"a.u13.s20.n","locale":"en-US","text":"Nói câu sau: \"My favorite sport is football.\""},"skillIds":["speaking","u13.grammar"],"type":"speakRepeat","vocabularyIds":["u13.sport","u13.football","u13.favorite"]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"uống"},{"id":"t2","text":"ti"},{"id":"t3","text":"tôi"},{"id":"t4","text":"xem"},{"id":"t5","text":"cà"},{"id":"t6","text":"đá"},{"id":"t7","text":"bóng"},{"id":"t8","text":"nghiệp"},{"id":"t9","text":"vi"},{"id":"t10","text":"Chúng"},{"id":"t11","text":"dương"},{"id":"t12","text":"trên"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"Chúng tôi xem bóng đá trên ti vi.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t10","t3","t4","t7","t6","t12","t2","t9"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"watch\" = xem; \"football\" = bóng đá","id":"u13n7l1-e14","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Dịch sang tiếng Việt: \"We watch football on TV.\""},"skillIds":["u13.grammar"],"type":"wordBank","vocabularyIds":["u13.watch","u13.football"]},{"content":{"maxChars":200,"placeholder":"Viết bằng tiếng Anh"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"This game is easy.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["This game is easy."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"\"easy\" = dễ; \"game\" = trò chơi","id":"u13n7l1-e15","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Trò chơi này dễ."},"skillIds":["u13.grammar"],"type":"textTranslation","vocabularyIds":["u7.easy","u13.game"]}],"gradingRulesVersion":"g1","guideText":"Mẫu câu chính: \"What is your hobby?\" (Sở thích của bạn là gì?) — \"I like to draw.\" (Tôi thích vẽ.) — \"My favorite sport is football.\" (Môn thể thao yêu thích của tôi là bóng đá.)\nLike + to V hoặc like + V-ing đều đúng: \"I like to dance\" = \"I like dancing\".\nPlay + môn thể thao (play football — không có \"the\"); play + the + nhạc cụ (play the piano, play the guitar).\nTrạng từ tần suất \"often\" đứng trước động từ thường: \"I often listen to music.\"\n\"Together\" (cùng nhau) thường đứng cuối câu: \"We play games together.\"","lessonId":"u13n7l1","lessonVersion":"v2.u13n7l1","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u13n7","order":102,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u13n7l1","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"lf5i-odusmxQNSLNurtF1_3eRTaNBN3F9nolMsdcCwwj4JDwjn0rZE_GQi-bTFPesHmpzgoGGoAtit6VDvJ_DQ","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u13.grammar","listening","speaking","u13.dialogue","reading","u13.story","u13.vocab"],"title":"Ôn tập cửa ải · Bài 1","unitId":"u13"}